flowchart TD
    A[Incident, threshold breach, control failure, or resilience gap] --> B{Potentially material?}
    B -- No --> C[Normal owner governance]
    B -- Yes --> D[Notify CISO, CRO, accountable executive]
    D --> E[State facts, unknowns, impact, containment, next update]
    E --> F{Board-level or delegated-authority trigger?}
    F -- No --> G[Executive risk governance and treatment]
    F -- Yes --> H[Notify BRC Chair / Board per protocol]
    G --> I[Record owner, decision, due date, evidence]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Update board report and close loop]
